WEBVTT

00:33.580 --> 00:37.020
=Royal Upstart 2=
(Based on "Zhenguan Foolish Son-in-Law")

00:37.250 --> 00:39.810
=Episode 8=

00:39.810 --> 00:42.450
(Imperial Edict Arrives)

00:43.087 --> 00:45.127
I said I'm going
to be granted a count title.

00:51.287 --> 00:52.406
Aunt, what are you doing?

00:52.927 --> 00:56.607
You've been acting strange
ever since you came out of prison.

00:56.726 --> 00:57.447
Aunt,

00:58.086 --> 00:59.407
I'm not acting strange.

01:01.927 --> 01:02.727
Aunt,

01:02.727 --> 01:03.727
think about it.

01:04.087 --> 01:05.806
Why would the Princess let me out?

01:11.247 --> 01:13.447
So the Princess saw you were unwell

01:13.447 --> 01:15.366
and let you out because of that.

01:15.446 --> 01:16.287
Mister Wang,

01:16.287 --> 01:17.887
quick, call a physician.

01:18.046 --> 01:18.847
No need.

01:20.366 --> 01:21.287
No,

01:21.686 --> 01:23.726
before, even though you got into fights,

01:24.167 --> 01:25.527
even though you were foolish,

01:25.807 --> 01:27.686
you weren't out of your mind.

01:27.887 --> 01:30.287
But now you've lost your senses.

01:30.366 --> 01:32.887
What hope does this family have left?

01:32.887 --> 01:35.406
What's the use of all that money then?

01:35.406 --> 01:36.726
Aunt, calm down.

01:37.326 --> 01:38.366
I'm really fine.

01:38.366 --> 01:40.126
What will it take for you to believe me?

01:43.927 --> 01:44.527
Alright.

01:44.646 --> 01:45.646
I'll tell the truth.

01:45.686 --> 01:46.807
I got into a fight.

01:46.810 --> 01:48.560
They're coming
first thing tomorrow morning.

01:50.046 --> 01:50.686
Really.

01:51.206 --> 01:53.647
I beat up an official's son.

01:53.647 --> 01:54.406
Injured him.

01:54.406 --> 01:55.607
They know who I am,

01:55.967 --> 01:58.126
so they'll be here early tomorrow.

01:58.326 --> 01:59.206
Is that enough?

01:59.527 --> 02:01.126
You brat!

02:01.406 --> 02:03.727
Now you even dare lie to me?

02:03.967 --> 02:05.807
Let's see if I don't
beat you to death today.

02:07.926 --> 02:09.367
It wasn't that serious.

02:09.566 --> 02:11.007
You beat an official's son

02:11.007 --> 02:12.286
and still say it wasn't serious?

02:12.566 --> 02:12.887
No,

02:12.887 --> 02:14.247
today I must beat you.

02:18.527 --> 02:19.406
Young Madam,

02:19.527 --> 02:20.887
I said before,

02:20.887 --> 02:23.126
someone like him will never change.

02:23.220 --> 02:25.126
Just as expected,
he's still the same as before,

02:25.126 --> 02:26.390
never giving anyone peace of mind.

02:26.647 --> 02:29.367
Young Madam, you should have
taught him a proper lesson earlier.

02:30.607 --> 02:32.486
He beat an official's son.

02:33.367 --> 02:35.447
When their family comes tomorrow,

02:35.807 --> 02:38.046
and they see he
doesn't even have a scratch,

02:38.046 --> 02:39.527
they'll be even more furious.

02:41.406 --> 02:43.607
But if he were injured as well,

02:43.766 --> 02:45.807
perhaps the matter could be eased.

02:47.447 --> 02:50.087
Today the Imperial Guards delivered
eight thousand guan.

02:50.486 --> 02:52.406
I'm quite startled at first.

02:53.967 --> 02:55.807
This is the money earned in a single day

02:55.807 --> 02:57.647
by Wei the Fool's glaze workshop.

02:57.846 --> 02:59.006
In a single day?

03:00.767 --> 03:01.487
Your Majesty,

03:01.807 --> 03:03.087
this is a good thing.

03:03.406 --> 03:04.726
I didn't expect Wei the Fool

03:04.726 --> 03:06.286
to have such ability.

03:06.327 --> 03:08.647
Your Majesty should
reward Wei Hao generously.

03:09.006 --> 03:11.166
I intend to grant him a count title.

03:11.166 --> 03:12.207
What do you think?

03:13.367 --> 03:16.166
Isn't a count title a bit too light?

03:17.047 --> 03:18.767
He didn't just produce

03:18.767 --> 03:20.367
beautiful glazed gemstones.

03:20.767 --> 03:21.726
More importantly,

03:21.767 --> 03:23.527
he has helped the royal family greatly.

03:23.566 --> 03:24.327
Originally,

03:24.807 --> 03:27.126
I could have granted
him a marquis title.

03:27.406 --> 03:28.846
But that mouth of his,

03:29.087 --> 03:29.927
when he speaks,

03:29.927 --> 03:31.647
he can infuriate people to death.

03:31.647 --> 03:33.886
Granting him a count title
is already me holding back.

03:33.886 --> 03:36.006
Otherwise, I wouldn't even want
to grant him anything.

03:36.406 --> 03:37.686
What does this mean?

03:37.927 --> 03:38.846
This man,

03:38.846 --> 03:40.327
he speaks without thinking,

03:40.446 --> 03:41.967
and can't keep his hands to himself.

03:42.286 --> 03:44.647
Today he even got into
a fight with Commander Cheng.

03:45.726 --> 03:46.886
So foolish.

03:47.487 --> 03:48.327
Exactly.

03:48.726 --> 03:49.367
Ning'an,

03:49.527 --> 03:50.207
from now on,

03:50.566 --> 03:51.807
see him less.

03:51.967 --> 03:53.967
This boy is full of schemes,

03:54.020 --> 03:55.647
and he even dares set his sights on you.

03:56.047 --> 03:56.846
What?

03:57.327 --> 03:58.686
He's even set his sights on you?

03:59.327 --> 04:00.446
What's going on here?

04:00.446 --> 04:01.247
Mother,

04:01.566 --> 04:03.446
that's just Wei the Fool
talking nonsense.

04:03.487 --> 04:04.647
I don't think so.

04:04.647 --> 04:06.686
I think this boy is ready to go all out.

04:06.686 --> 04:07.566
Father,

04:08.047 --> 04:09.047
I'm hungry.

04:09.047 --> 04:10.927
Please go dine with Mother.

04:10.927 --> 04:11.886
Alright.

04:11.886 --> 04:13.406
Go on. Hurry.

04:18.367 --> 04:19.166
Young Master,

04:20.927 --> 04:21.726
Young Master.

04:21.886 --> 04:22.726
This...

04:25.207 --> 04:26.166
You must be freezing.

04:26.166 --> 04:26.726
Come.

04:28.286 --> 04:30.247
I told you not to fight,
told you not to fight,

04:30.247 --> 04:30.886
but you wouldn't listen.

04:30.886 --> 04:31.927
You just had to fight.

04:31.927 --> 04:32.686
Look.

04:32.686 --> 04:33.846
Aunt has gone mad.

04:34.166 --> 04:36.406
I told her the truth,
and she says I'm mad.

04:36.500 --> 04:38.790
I said I got into a fight,
and she still wants to beat me.

04:38.807 --> 04:39.927
What am I supposed to do?

04:42.286 --> 04:44.286
Young Master,
just like when you were little,

04:44.286 --> 04:45.790
then you must have gotten into a fight.

04:46.406 --> 04:46.967
Forget it.

04:47.527 --> 04:49.047
Young Madam must be asleep by now.

04:49.047 --> 04:50.247
You should rest early too.

04:50.247 --> 04:51.527
You don't believe me either,

04:53.006 --> 04:53.807
do you?

04:54.247 --> 04:56.527
(Who doesn't know
you're a fool, Young Master?)

04:56.530 --> 04:57.927
(You said you'd be granted a title.)

04:57.927 --> 04:59.286
(Who would believe that?)

04:59.606 --> 05:00.406
I believe.

05:00.486 --> 05:01.246
I believe.

05:01.246 --> 05:02.007
Young Master,

05:02.887 --> 05:03.726
rest early.

05:05.327 --> 05:06.127
Young Master,

05:06.447 --> 05:07.647
if you can't sleep,

05:07.806 --> 05:08.246
then

05:08.806 --> 05:10.606
I can warm you.

05:10.606 --> 05:11.486
You should go.

05:11.687 --> 05:12.726
I want some quiet alone.

05:13.366 --> 05:14.606
Then rest early.

05:52.606 --> 05:53.527
(Hao.)

05:54.007 --> 05:55.846
(You're actually quite handsome.)

05:56.887 --> 05:58.726
(If people didn't know you're a fool,)

05:58.887 --> 05:59.846
(they'd probably think)

05:59.846 --> 06:01.560
(you're quite
the refined young gentleman.)

06:06.207 --> 06:07.726
You're the only family I have.

06:08.087 --> 06:09.887
If you really
get taken away by officials,

06:09.967 --> 06:10.846
what will I do?

06:12.527 --> 06:13.327
Hao,

06:13.567 --> 06:15.486
don't blame me for being harsh today.

06:19.207 --> 06:20.967
If I hit him while he's asleep,

06:20.967 --> 06:22.447
it must hurt a lot, right?

06:22.647 --> 06:24.046
What if he gets startled?

06:31.606 --> 06:32.486
Stop it.

06:35.726 --> 06:37.726
Are you asking for a beating?

06:38.087 --> 06:40.286
Who dares disturb my sleep?

06:42.007 --> 06:43.046
Who do you think you are?

06:43.166 --> 06:44.366
Who do you think you are?

06:45.207 --> 06:46.007
Aunt?

06:46.246 --> 06:47.806
You beat an official's son,

06:47.806 --> 06:48.767
and you're still
acting like some big shot?

06:48.767 --> 06:49.327
Father, Mother, save me!

06:49.327 --> 06:50.710
You still dare call for your parents?

06:50.726 --> 06:52.926
Today I'll discipline you
on their behalf.

06:55.007 --> 06:55.687
Wait,

06:55.887 --> 06:56.647
don't hit me!

06:56.650 --> 06:57.790
Are you going to keep fighting?

06:59.290 --> 07:00.007
Say one more word!

07:00.166 --> 07:01.406
Aunt, don't lose your senses!

07:01.406 --> 07:02.127
Say one more word!

07:02.687 --> 07:03.447
Stop hitting me!

07:03.447 --> 07:04.046
Help!

07:04.046 --> 07:05.046
Are you done yet?

07:08.000 --> 07:09.787
(Wei Mansion)

07:19.246 --> 07:20.286
I've decided.

07:21.360 --> 07:22.486
I'm splitting the household.

07:23.447 --> 07:24.246
I...

07:24.567 --> 07:26.486
I'll go buy a house later.

07:27.127 --> 07:28.486
I'm moving out.

07:29.046 --> 07:30.767
What kind of aunt are you?

07:31.327 --> 07:32.447
Beating me is one thing,

07:32.447 --> 07:34.366
but hitting me while I'm asleep?

07:37.527 --> 07:38.527
Don't touch me.

07:40.486 --> 07:42.286
What kind of aunt does that?

07:44.647 --> 07:46.806
Wasn't I doing it for your own good?

07:47.200 --> 07:49.880
As long as you don't end up
in the Ministry of Justice Prison again.

07:50.527 --> 07:52.286
You beat an official's son.

07:52.300 --> 07:54.090
When his family comes
do you think they'll spare you?

07:54.207 --> 07:56.246
But if they see you like this,

07:56.327 --> 07:58.087
they might take pity on you.

07:58.087 --> 07:59.750
We'll just compensate them
with some money.

07:59.767 --> 08:00.166
Right?

08:03.647 --> 08:04.246
I...

08:05.327 --> 08:05.806
I...

08:06.087 --> 08:07.087
I didn't fight.

08:07.926 --> 08:08.726
No.

08:10.647 --> 08:11.967
They're here!

08:12.166 --> 08:12.967
Young Madam,

08:13.327 --> 08:14.166
they've arrived.

08:15.207 --> 08:16.726
Looks like quite a large group,

08:17.327 --> 08:18.687
seems like people from the palace.

08:20.246 --> 08:21.327
From the palace?

08:22.527 --> 08:23.046
Let's go.

08:26.166 --> 08:27.127
Slow down, Young Madam.

08:27.647 --> 08:28.567
Mister Wang!

08:29.366 --> 08:30.447
Mister Wang!

08:31.286 --> 08:32.806
Do something!

08:41.246 --> 08:42.046
(Heavens.)

08:43.046 --> 08:45.127
(This fool hit someone from the palace.)

08:45.286 --> 08:45.806
(Then...)

08:46.327 --> 08:47.767
(Is there any hope left?)

08:48.366 --> 08:49.926
Is this Wei Hao's residence?

08:50.647 --> 08:53.606
Yes...

08:53.887 --> 08:55.246
Eunuch, please.

08:56.767 --> 08:58.127
Where is Wei Hao?

08:59.207 --> 09:01.166
And who are you?

09:02.447 --> 09:04.726
I am Wei Hao's aunt.

09:05.007 --> 09:05.767
Hao.

09:05.767 --> 09:06.527
Quick.

09:06.527 --> 09:07.647
Call Hao here.

09:07.967 --> 09:08.767
Young Master.

09:08.767 --> 09:09.567
Move aside.

09:11.046 --> 09:11.846
Slow down.

09:12.687 --> 09:13.567
Greetings, Eunuch.

09:16.646 --> 09:17.886
You...

09:18.246 --> 09:19.047
This...

09:21.366 --> 09:22.167
I fell.

09:24.006 --> 09:24.927
No, he didn't fall.

09:26.126 --> 09:27.407
I beat him.

09:28.087 --> 09:28.886
Eunuch,

09:29.207 --> 09:31.327
this is Hao's fault.

09:32.447 --> 09:33.366
He...

09:34.766 --> 09:37.447
He's not right in the head.

09:38.726 --> 09:41.526
You see, I've already
beaten him like this.

09:41.526 --> 09:43.687
He'll surely learn his lesson.

09:43.687 --> 09:45.567
Please be magnanimous

09:45.567 --> 09:47.167
and spare him.

09:49.207 --> 09:49.687
(This...)

09:49.967 --> 09:51.766
(What are they even talking about?)

09:51.846 --> 09:53.886
(Wei Hao hasn't offended me at all.)

09:54.287 --> 09:55.087
Eunuch,

09:55.775 --> 09:57.456
let's handle official business first.

09:58.447 --> 10:00.567
Then set up the incense altar.

10:00.567 --> 10:03.486
We should first carry out
His Majesty's instructions.

10:04.807 --> 10:05.606
What?

10:06.006 --> 10:06.990
Set up the incense altar?

10:07.447 --> 10:08.246
His Majesty?

10:09.047 --> 10:11.687
(This fool must have beaten a prince.)

10:12.087 --> 10:12.927
You all,

10:13.366 --> 10:14.606
go set up the altar.

10:14.846 --> 10:15.526
Hurry.

10:15.526 --> 10:16.726
(Qichi)
Quickly, get it done.

10:19.447 --> 10:21.807
We can't stay in this courtyard anymore.

10:23.726 --> 10:25.366
(This family is finished.)

10:25.646 --> 10:27.567
(It's the end of everything.)

10:33.646 --> 10:34.606
Eunuch, please.

10:38.807 --> 10:40.006
The imperial edict arrives.

10:40.126 --> 10:41.846
Wei Hao, receive the edict.

10:43.380 --> 10:43.967
Young Master.

10:43.967 --> 10:44.486
Step aside.

10:47.287 --> 10:50.047
(This may be the last time I see Hao.)

10:50.047 --> 10:52.486
(He'll probably be taken away soon.)

10:54.366 --> 10:55.886
By the Mandate of Heaven,

10:55.927 --> 10:57.366
the Emperor decrees,

10:57.567 --> 11:00.967
Wei Hao, for assisting the Princess
in crafting treasures, has rendered merit.

11:01.047 --> 11:02.807
He is hereby granted

11:02.967 --> 11:04.927
one thousand five hundred mu of land,

11:05.726 --> 11:08.167
a fief of seven hundred households,

11:08.567 --> 11:10.726
with three hundred
households under direct grant,

11:11.447 --> 11:14.567
and is conferred the title
Dynasty-Founding County Count of Pingyang.

11:14.927 --> 11:16.486
Respect this.

11:17.447 --> 11:18.447
Thank you, Your Majesty!

11:18.447 --> 11:19.167
What?

11:19.327 --> 11:21.207
Dynasty-Founding
County Count of Pingyang?

11:29.200 --> 11:32.030
♪Everyone says I'm a big silly fool♪

11:32.650 --> 11:36.050
♪When things happen,
I only know how to count on my fingers♪

11:36.820 --> 11:39.770
♪They shake their heads
and say I'm pitiful♪

11:40.110 --> 11:42.810
♪Sigh and walk away♪

11:44.410 --> 11:47.880
♪Little do they know,
I am sharp and bright♪

11:47.880 --> 11:50.110
♪With a heart like a mirror,
I understand the world's♪

11:50.110 --> 11:52.220
♪Colors and darkness♪

11:52.220 --> 11:54.240
♪But I keep my edge hidden♪

11:54.240 --> 11:58.600
♪The day I become famous
is just around the corner♪

12:00.040 --> 12:03.770
♪In the hotpot restaurant,
skewers boil in the broth♪

12:04.040 --> 12:07.640
♪People come and go,
with few worries or troubles♪

12:07.800 --> 12:09.880
♪The clacking of the abacus rings out♪

12:09.880 --> 12:14.670
♪See me differently.
Who dares to challenge me?♪

12:14.890 --> 12:16.510
♪The world mistakes me♪

12:16.510 --> 12:18.850
♪For an ignorant and stubborn fool♪

12:18.920 --> 12:20.110
♪As the storm approaches♪

12:20.110 --> 12:22.510
♪I just shrug and watch with a smile♪

12:22.720 --> 12:24.440
♪This foolish image is convenient♪

12:24.440 --> 12:26.420
♪I use it as a protective shield♪

12:26.590 --> 12:28.340
♪Navigating with ease, I attract♪

12:28.340 --> 12:30.440
♪A lucky star to accompany me♪

12:30.440 --> 12:31.910
♪In a peaceful golden age♪

12:31.910 --> 12:34.140
♪I hold my lady's hand
to watch the world♪

12:34.360 --> 12:35.560
♪Pouring youth and fireworks♪

12:35.560 --> 12:38.080
♪Into a precious glazed cup♪

12:38.210 --> 12:39.920
♪Having experienced life's changes♪

12:39.920 --> 12:41.200
♪And tasted its highs and lows♪

12:41.350 --> 12:42.770
♪My wish has finally come true♪

12:42.770 --> 12:43.810
♪To stay by your side♪

12:43.810 --> 12:45.730
♪In this fleeting world♪

12:45.900 --> 12:49.150
♪We are free and happy♪

12:53.150 --> 12:54.930
♪From a nobody♪

12:54.930 --> 12:56.830
♪To someone now famous♪

12:56.940 --> 12:58.370
♪Ordinary people laugh at me♪

12:58.370 --> 13:00.880
♪But I laugh at how
they cannot see through it all♪

13:00.980 --> 13:02.560
♪Let others plot and scheme♪

13:02.560 --> 13:04.630
♪I will keep my heart unchanged♪

13:04.840 --> 13:06.520
♪In this vast world♪

13:06.520 --> 13:08.520
♪I find my own leisurely freedom♪

13:08.670 --> 13:10.880
♪The world is bustling,
and things constantly change♪

13:10.880 --> 13:12.470
♪Everything ends eventually♪

13:12.560 --> 13:14.060
♪All that remains before my eyes♪

13:14.060 --> 13:16.460
♪Is this street wandering,
still tinged with pity♪

13:16.460 --> 13:18.170
♪No matter how time flies♪

13:18.170 --> 13:19.330
♪Even if the falling snow♪

13:19.330 --> 13:20.960
♪Dyes the hair at our temples white♪

13:20.960 --> 13:22.000
♪All I want now♪

13:22.000 --> 13:24.100
♪Is to pray for
my lady's peace and safety♪

13:24.100 --> 13:27.360
♪Year after year♪
